    "code": "\tSELECTOR\n\t\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\t\tIF IsObjectNearby? THEN\n\t\t\t\tDO GraspObject\n\t\tEND\n\t\tDO MoveToNextLocation\n\t\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\t\tIF IsObjectInHand? THEN\n\t\t\t\tDO ReleaseObject\n\t\tELSE\n\t\t\tDO CheckObjectProperties\n\t\tEND\n\t\tDO WaitForNextTask\n\tEND\n"
